  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object is held in position by a light string on an incline plane such that the angle θ to the horizontal is slowly increased from zero.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>Which statement is correct about the forces acting on the object as the angle θ is increased?<br/><br/></p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">The tension in the string remains constant.</li><li data-label=\"B\">The normal force decreases.</li><li data-label=\"C\">The weight component parallel to the slope remains constant.</li><li data-label=\"D\">The weight decreases.</li></ol>"
  },
